---
title: "Pasquale Mangialavori — Senior Frontend Engineer"
description: "Pasquale Mangialavori is a Senior Frontend Engineer at Scandit, based in Barcelona, building web platforms and open-source JavaScript/TypeScript tools."
ogDescription: "Senior Frontend Engineer at Scandit, based in Barcelona. Building web platforms and open-source JS/TS tools."
keywords: "Pasquale Mangialavori, frontend engineer, Scandit, Barcelona, JavaScript, TypeScript, React, Web Components, web developer"
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
            <section class="hero" id="hero">
                <div class="hero-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                <canvas class="hero-smoke" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
                <div class="container hero-grid">
                    <div class="hero-copy">
                        <span class="eyebrow"
                            >Senior Frontend Engineer · Barcelona</span
                        >
                        <h1
                            class="title title--hero"
                            aria-label="Pasquale Mangialavori"
                        >
                            <type-writer
                                aria-hidden="true"
                                autostart
                                typingdelay="55">
                                Pasquale <br/>
                                Mangialavori
                            </type-writer
                            >
                            <span class="print-only-name"
                                >Pasquale Mangialavori</span
                            >
                        </h1>
                        <p class="body-copy hero-tagline">
                            I build fast, well-crafted interfaces — and the
                            open-source tools that make building them easier.
                        </p>
                        <div class="hero-actions">
                            <a class="button button-primary" href="#experience"
                                >View experience</a
                            >
                            <a class="button button-outline" href="#contact"
                                >Get in touch</a
                            >
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hero-feature card-panel">
                        <div
                            class="hero-feature-gloss"
                            aria-hidden="true"
                        ></div>
                        <div class="hero-feature-inner">
                            <span class="status-badge"
                                >Currently at Scandit</span
                            >
                            <h2>
                                Building performant web experiences with
                                <span class="accent">Web Components</span>
                                and <span class="accent">React</span>
                            </h2>
                            <div class="hero-divider"></div>
                            <div class="feature-metrics">
                                <div class="feature-metric">
                                    <div class="feature-value">
                                        4+<small>yrs @ Scandit</small>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="feature-metric">
                                    <div class="feature-value">
                                        11+<small>yrs frontend</small>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="feature-metric">
                                    <div class="feature-value">
                                        BCN<small>Barcelona</small>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section class="section section-dark" id="about">
                <div class="container about-grid">
                    <div class="about-facts">
                        <span class="eyebrow reveal"
                            ><span class="screen-only">About</span
                            ><span class="print-only">Summary</span></span
                        >
                        <ul class="fact-list">
                            <li class="reveal"><strong>Also known as</strong> eatsjobs</li>
                            <li class="reveal"><strong>Based in</strong> Barcelona, Spain</li>
                            <li class="reveal"><strong>Currently at</strong> Scandit</li>
                            <li class="reveal">
                                <strong>From</strong> Tropea, Calabria, Italy
                            </li>
                            <li class="reveal">
                                <strong>Studied at</strong> La Sapienza (Rome)
                                &amp; University of Florence
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="about-copy">
                        <h2 class="title reveal">
                            A frontend engineer who grew up on 'nduja and red
                            onions
                        </h2>
                        <p class="body-copy reveal">{{ resume.basics.summary }}</p>
                        <p class="body-copy reveal screen-only">
                            When I'm not staring at a screen, I'm usually out
                            for a walk, playing beach volleyball or football,
                            swimming, or playing guitar and annoying the
                            neighbors.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section class="section section-light" id="experience">
                <div class="container">
                    <span class="eyebrow reveal">Experience</span>
                    <h2 class="title reveal">Where I've worked</h2>
                    <ol class="timeline">
                        {%- for company in resume.work | groupWork %}
                        <li class="timeline-item reveal">
                            <div class="timeline-header">
                                <h3>
                                    {{ company.name }}
                                    {%- if company.isCurrent %}
                                    <span class="timeline-badge">Current</span>
                                    {%- endif %}
                                </h3>
                                <span class="timeline-dates"
                                    >{{ company.startDate | monthYear }} – {{ company.endDate | monthYear }}</span
                                >
                            </div>
                            <span class="timeline-location">{{ company.location }}</span>
                            <ul class="timeline-roles">
                                {%- for role in company.positions %}
                                <li class="timeline-role">
                                    <div class="timeline-role-header">
                                        <h4>{{ role.position }}</h4>
                                        <span class="timeline-role-dates"
                                            >{{ role.startDate | monthYear }} – {{ role.endDate | monthYear }}</span
                                        >
                                    </div>
                                    <p class="body-copy timeline-desc">
                                        {{ role.summary | inlineLinks | safe }}
                                    </p>
                                </li>
                                {%- endfor %}
                            </ul>
                        </li>
                        {%- endfor %}
                    </ol>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section class="section section-dark" id="projects">
                <div class="container">
                    <span class="eyebrow reveal"
                        ><span class="screen-only">Projects</span
                        ><span class="print-only">Open source</span></span
                    >
                    <h2 class="title reveal">A few things I've built</h2>
                    <div class="projects-grid">
                        {%- for project in resume.projects %}
                        <a
                            class="project-card reveal"
                            href="{{ project.url }}"
                            data-print-url="{{ project.url | printableUrl }}"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="noreferrer"
                        >
                            <h3>{{ project.name }}</h3>
                            <p class="body-copy">{{ project.description }}</p>
                            <span class="link-button link-draw"
                                >{% if "github.com" in project.url %}View on GitHub{% else %}Play the demo{% endif %} →</span
                            >
                        </a>
                        {%- endfor %}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
            <!-- The CV's closing sections. On screen the same facts sit in the
                 About sidebar, so keep the two in step. -->
            <section class="section print-only" id="cv-extra">
                <div class="container">
                    <span class="eyebrow">Education</span>
                    <p class="body-copy">
                        {%- for school in resume.education %}
                        {{ school.institution }}{% if school.studyType %}, {{ school.studyType | lower }}{% endif %}
                        {%- if not loop.last %} ·{% endif %}
                        {%- endfor %}
                    </p>
                    <span class="eyebrow">Also</span>
                    <p class="body-copy">
                        From Tropea, Calabria, Italy · Also known as eatsjobs
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section class="section section-light" id="contact">
                <div class="container">
                    <span class="eyebrow reveal">Contact</span>
                    <h2 class="title reveal">Let's connect</h2>
                    <p class="body-copy contact-intro reveal">
                        Best way to reach me is through one of these — happy to
                        talk frontend, open source, or beach volleyball.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="social-links">
                        <li class="print-only">
                            <a
                                href="{{ resume.basics.url }}"
                                data-print-url="{{ resume.basics.url | printableUrl }}"
                                >Website</a
                            >
                        </li>
                        {%- for profile in resume.basics.profiles %}
                        <li class="reveal">
                            <a
                                href="{{ profile.url }}"
                                data-print-url="{{ profile.url | printableUrl }}"
                                target="_blank"
                                rel="me noreferrer"
                                >{% include "icons/" + (profile.network | lower | replace(" ", "-") | replace(".", "-")) + ".svg" %}{{ profile.network }}</a
                            >
                        </li>
                        {%- endfor %}
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </section>
